{"agent_id": "Claude Code", "kind": "DECISION", "product": "niyantrak", "session_id": "build-record", "src": "BR-DEC-01", "text": "The login record and the system's user directory give the name; a stable directory id survives renames. Agents are recorded as acting for that person.", "title": "Who acted is derived from the operating system, never typed", "ts": "2026-10-23T12:00:00.000000000", "user_id": "founder"}
{"agent_id": "Claude Code", "dst": "niyantrak", "kind": "ABOUT", "product": "niyantrak", "session_id": "build-record", "src": "BR-DEC-01", "title": "BR-DEC-01 about niyantrak", "ts": "2026-10-23T13:00:00.000000000", "user_id": "founder"}
{"agent_id": "Claude Code", "kind": "DECISION", "product": "niyantrak", "session_id": "build-record", "src": "BR-DEC-02", "text": "Changing the gate is self-modification and is refused. Restarts, staging and gate changes stay with the founder.", "title": "Agents never change their own gate", "ts": "2026-10-23T12:00:00.000000000", "user_id": "founder"}
{"agent_id": "Claude Code", "dst": "agent-gate", "kind": "ABOUT", "product": "niyantrak", "session_id": "build-record", "src": "BR-DEC-02", "title": "BR-DEC-02 about agent-gate", "ts": "2026-10-23T13:00:00.000000000", "user_id": "founder"}
{"agent_id": "Claude Code", "kind": "DECISION", "product": "niyantrak", "session_id": "build-record", "src": "BR-DEC-03", "text": "Set mid-launch, after two agents had continued past a block (see the disclosed slips).", "title": "After a gate block the agent stops: no other tool, no rewording", "ts": "2026-10-23T12:00:00.000000000", "user_id": "founder"}
{"agent_id": "Claude Code", "dst": "agent-gate", "kind": "ABOUT", "product": "niyantrak", "session_id": "build-record", "src": "BR-DEC-03", "title": "BR-DEC-03 about agent-gate", "ts": "2026-10-23T13:00:00.000000000", "user_id": "founder"}
{"agent_id": "Claude Code", "kind": "DECISION", "product": "niyantrak", "session_id": "build-record", "src": "BR-DEC-04", "text": "A history scan found a personal email on nine early commits, so the public repository was exported fresh under the company identity. The leak scan runs on the tree and the history before every push.", "title": "Public history starts fresh at v0.1.0", "ts": "2026-10-23T12:00:00.000000000", "user_id": "founder"}
